{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X对人物动机和段落间因果的交代不如Y充分，尤其S05—S07、S13的心理转折，需要观众自己补上一部分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的主旨句短、重点突出，扫一眼就容易抓住每段的情感变化，而且感受描写有丰富的声音细节、身体感受和情绪层次，边听边看更容易形成即时体验。Y的优势是人物动机交代得更完整，前后心理变化的因果关系更清楚，尤其结尾对开头的呼应更明确。但Y有些段落需要连续读完较长的句子才能理解，削弱了短时间扫屏的效率。综合考虑，我选X，但它值得吸收Y对人物心理因果的补充。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4be55f23-5014-4167-b408-9d7277519508", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T212414398833Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.671, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:25:15.095564+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0f4e772890201facdbf04de0a79d7698c703eb5c04219f0d0818650f8539baf7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_a